# Architecture

**Scope:** presign upload / download / delete — no trivial SDK wrappers (`s3.put` and proxy `GET /file` are the exceptions). Auth → consumer guards. Optional quota checks in `@dimah-s3/db`. Optional DB via `@dimah-s3/db` `db()` plugin. Prefer one feature per named route; combine only when those callers share the key namespace. Client constraints come from `GET /routes`. Hook `route` is `S3RouteName` (augment `DimahS3Routes`).

**Deps:** `core` ← `server` | `react` ← `ui`; `db` → `server` (peer); CLI is separate (scaffold only). UI: Fuma Translate. API errors: stable `code` + English `message` (client-localized). Protocol SSOT: `@dimah-s3/core` (`S3_API_ROUTES`, `createS3Client`). Plugins: `definePlugin` in `server/src/plugin/`; contexts flatten onto `s3[id]`.

**Registry:** edit `packages/ui/src/components/dimah-s3/`, `hooks/`, `lib/` — never hand-edit `packages/ui/src/components/ui/` (stock shadcn; refresh with `sync:shadcn`) or `packages/ui/registry.json` (generated).

**CLI:** edit `packages/cli/src/` + `templates/` — never hand-edit `packages/cli/dist/templates/`.

